 "description": "Use this when someone asks how to design a part for FDM 3D printing: wall thickness, tolerances, hole clearances, overhangs and supports, orientation, infill, bosses, ribs, snap fits, threaded inserts, dimensional accuracy, published material figures, or printing compared with molding or machining. It takes a topic or the question and returns short answers with their published sources and a link to the full page. It does not check a specific file.",
